  "bodyHash": "BA4F37b4k3Y=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更好的三叉戟為三叉戟帶來了一些微小但非常需要的改進。尤其是忠誠附魔變得更加實用，甚至還有三叉戟本身的合成配方！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三叉戟終於有合成配方了！海底遺蹟中的三隻遠古深海守衛每隻都會掉落一個新的三叉戟碎片物品。將這三個碎片與一些海晶碎片組合，就能獲得全新的三叉戟！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">使用一些海晶碎片在鐵砧上修理即將耗盡耐久的的三叉戟。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">三叉戟在撿回時總是會回到它被投擲出去的欄位。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">當附有忠誠附魔時，意外丟入虛空的三叉戟會返回，而不是從你的世界中消失。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">任何生物掉落的戰利品（包括物品和經驗值）都會隨著任何附有忠誠附魔的三叉戟一同飛向你。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">穿刺效果現在與基岩版相同：任何與水或雨水接觸的生物都會受到額外傷害，而不僅僅是特定類型的水生生物。</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">客戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行配置（在 Fabric 上需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">，作者 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，也需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動配置，所有檔案均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"> 資料夾中，命名方式為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">，視配置類型而定。並非所有類型都存在，且某些模組可能沒有任何配置檔案。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/SimplySarc\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SimplySarc</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"> 啟發了本模組的三叉戟合成機制，源自其影片 </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KNwi8gPengY&amp;t=74s\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Improving The Update Aquatic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/releasehun\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">releaseHUN</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"> 創作了那精美的三叉戟碎片材質。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/zero_dsrs_vx\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Zero_DSRS_VX</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"> 提供了使用海晶碎片在鐵砧上修理三叉戟的點子，源自其模組 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repairable-tridents-fabric\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Repairable Tridents</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/overflowing-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-item-frames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
